{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_vrtx_01A4GavffsjV7qHBv5YWu6UR","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Done. Here's what was completed:\n\n**Q34 written:** `answers/03-034-evaluate-agent-performance-tool-selection-action-advancement.md`\n\nThe answer covers a **three-dimension eval framework**:\n\n1. **Tool selection accuracy** — offline golden-dataset benchmarks (annotated correct tool call per step → selection accuracy + arg hallucination rate) and production telemetry (tool error rate per tool per day, 2σ alerting on schema breaks).\n\n2. **Action advancement** — steps-to-completion ratio vs expert trajectory (>2× signals over-planning), no-progress rate in production (identical action fingerprints across 2 consecutive steps = stuck run), and task completion rate (TCR) as the headline production metric.\n\n3. **Context/goal adherence** — LLM-judge with a full-trajectory rubric for offline and sampled production eval, cosine similarity drift tracking (goal embedding vs step summaries, alert at <0.65) for real-time monitoring.\n\n**Key production tradeoff:** LLM judge on 100% of runs costs ~$200/day at 10K runs — use it on 5% sample + 100% golden regressions, and use cheaper proxy metrics (cosine drift, TCR, tool error rate) for the rest. Gate deployments on offline golden-dataset benchmarks.\n\n**4 items remain in Next:** Q35–Q38 + validate."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":355,"cache_read_input_tokens":68905,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":355,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":1},"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"e409ffd4-9aa5-48ad-b21a-be70b2deaa08","uuid":"6b5e24db-0f8c-44f6-a092-c03fa322b522"}
